    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ingest email threads\nKeep an up-to-date database of all email threads to use downstream.\n\nFor example, to follow up on an email, to fine-tune a model, to capture actions, etc.",
        "width": 368
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -448,
        -208
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "03540089-e07a-4470-bd7e-54657a2b981c",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Determine what to ingest\nIf there is no data in the database, collect a certain amount (e.g., 6M = 6 months)\n\nOtherwise, get data as of the last ingestion.\n\n**Do we remove old threads?**\nNo. This code gets the last 6 months (default) and then continues to store as long as the workflow runs. It does not keep a \"running 6 months\" for example.",
        "height": 208,
        "width": 640
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        176,
        -592
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "f1b27702-4012-4a7a-9fea-dec55a6ce4db",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Collect threads to ingest\nIf there is no data in the database, collect a certain amount (eg 6M = 6 months)\n\nOtherwise, get data as of the last ingestion.",
        "height": 208,
        "width": 416
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
